<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκινάκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, Persian word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>short straight sword</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> (v. infr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.2.27
			</span></i> (also acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άκεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.118
				</span></i>
			; pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άκεας</span>
			v.l. ib. <i><span class="en">
				128
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπίχρυσος</span>, a Persian
				<i>sword</i> kept in the Parthenon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				1.170.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.646.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νὴ τὸν ἀκινάκην</span>, a
			Scythian oath, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>JTr.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. [<i>a^ci_na^ces</i> in Hor.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Od.</u>
				1.27.5
			</span></i>.]</div>
